    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cddd82f0f0828ca39c9be5c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（我、我理想的对象……诶？！这、这意思是……\r\n等、等等……哎哎……先冷静下来呀我……！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "769f86bd4e9aac85b6b72d928c10d0744227d085048185c71b88ba783734f2f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
