        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11e014547df7be8ba89ef9b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……好的，我明白了。\r\n也就是所谓……养精蓄锐对吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e287fd47a9055940ee3f36fc80c0552fe961f5e6257949c89f81abccbba4953d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13132d86fe3ff802eebd1e15",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然我嘴巴上这么说……但的确如罗布罗伊所说，\r\n从训练量上来看的话，她的体力应该还很充沛才对。\r\n……是精神方面有些太疲劳了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b853d71869544647bd2a7a44b3ceaba4719c56a0729b784053ec5f95af751356",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
